/-! Lane owner:b-weighted-level-8, unit 2, segment 2d, piece 10: the exit bank of the complete
level-`j` round (`LevelJClean2.level_dims_clean_j`) on `HStack`, cell by cell, as needed by the
install step of round `j+1`:

* `exit_blank_j`: every `HStack` cell that is not a master cell is BLANK in
  `blankBridge (S2J …)` (the scalar region is cleared by owner-4's clean except the kept writer
  slots, which lie in the bridge region; the save region is cleared; the writer index/extra
  cells, the outer region, the scale scratch and `tmpH` are blank);
* `exit_master_w7_j`, `exit_master_nat3_j`, `exit_master_other_j`: the master region, i.e. the
  masters `mS'` handed to round `j+1` satisfy `hV` (|V| in `w 7`), `hN` (every `nat 3 m`
  blank) and keep every master other than `Y`, `N`, `w 7`, `nat 3 _` (in particular `Gw`, the
  graph word, used by the install step). Masters C, B, Y, E are the level-`(j+1)` words by
  `level_dims_clean_j`. -/

namespace EthInapproximability.CurrentPaper.ExitP

